Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:03.18,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,If you're the protagonist of an eroge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:06.18,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,you often have a\Nglamorous personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.49,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Senpai you can rely on,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.25,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,heroines who adore you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.88,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,and a story that's promised\Nto end in success.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.39,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,It's totally understandable\Nthat it's set up that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:27.02,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,as a majority of users are looking\Nfor that kind of happy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:28.73,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Good morning, Kou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.71,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Could I ask you to go wake up Hatsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:32.78,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.92,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Then how about the sidekick\Ncharacter in an eroge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:38.78,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I won't pretend that he's\Nalways having a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.69,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Hatsumi-neesan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.79,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,It's time for breakfast, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:46.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Get up, Nee-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.34,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,If you don't wake up, you'll be la—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.93,main,Hatsumi,0,0,0,,You're supposed to call me Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:00.20,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,But this one is having a grand time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:03.06,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I'd even say I'm doing as well\Nas any eroge protagonist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:04.98,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,At least I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:09.98,sign_35245_386_Reborn_as_a_Side,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs23\move(262,73,265,83,16,4979)}{\blur2}{\c&H000000&}That's a{\c&H6E00E7&} Pink {\c&H000000&}Bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.51,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:46.59,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I guess we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.55,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,What about the next class?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:54.88,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,It's fine. I've attended enough days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:55.57,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.12,main,Katorina,0,0,0,,He's skipping class again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:01.91,main,Iori,0,0,0,,Kousuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:04.81,main,Classmates,0,0,0,,Damn him, he offended\NLudivine-sama again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:06.79,main,Classmates,0,0,0,,He should know his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.67,main,Classmates,0,0,0,,What a deadbeat loser student...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:11.76,main,Classmates,0,0,0,,If he doesn't want to\Nstudy, why even come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.47,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master, are we going to a dungeon again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:18.14,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I think so. There's a\Nskill I want to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:21.88,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,But I need a permit to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.56,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Takioto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:26.01,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Ms. R-Ruija?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:27.07,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Geeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:29.11,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I knew you were skipping class!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:30.97,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,You better come with me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:31.65,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:35.26,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I found you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:37.23,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:44.36,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Actually, Hatsumi talked to me about\Nyou "being unable emit mana."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:45.57,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.67,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Hatsumi is actually my kouhai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.33,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,We used to go dungeon delving together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.92,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.06,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:56.36,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,What, Hatsumi didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.80,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nee-san doesn't really talk\Nabout stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:03.31,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But to me, she was unusually\Ntalkative about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:06.77,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,This is something I borrowed\Nbecause she told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.19,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.44,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,It's a mana measuring device!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.21,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,A mana measuring device?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.20,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,That's quite the interesting shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:20.65,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Why are there horns on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:21.53,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What about the massive\Namount of skull symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:25.79,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,And how come some of\Nthese switches are on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:29.63,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.17,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I just remembered an urgent appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:33.39,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.32,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,It's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:39.60,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,When I first saw it, I was also\Na bit worried, but it's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:42.40,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I borrowed it from the number one\Ngenius inventor at the Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.47,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,so if I say it's safe, it's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.35,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:49.05,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Has this been tested?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:52.84,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Who invented this thing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:55.63,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,You probably don't know her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:57.57,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But it was the third-year,\NAnemone-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:02.23,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I mean no disrespect,\Nbut we should return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:06.99,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But what if miracles really can happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.29,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:15.36,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Anemone-san is a guaranteed\Nsexy scientist companion in MagiEx.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:18.17,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,It's true that she's a genius, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.99,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you use it first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:22.19,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:25.13,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Besides, when I talked to\Nher about your condition,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:28.13,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,she said she had the perfect\Nthing and lent me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.25,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,And, if I report the result to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:33.15,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,she said she'd keep\N"that thing" under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.61,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:38.07,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Uh! Um, ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.40,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:43.32,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In MagiEx, the setting was\Nthat she had dirt on Ms. Ruija.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.91,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.01,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.22,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.94,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But you have to tell us\Nexactly what you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:53.80,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Wha? But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.13,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Well, we're... at the Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.55,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,so in terms of compliance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:58.30,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:01.88,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,progressing the relationship with\NMs. Ruija doesn't happen at the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.43,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The place you meet her is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:07.31,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC59BFF&\frz358.5\move(66,64,117,66,19,2855)}Encounter Cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:07.31,sign_10776_105_Boo_m,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\blur1\move(261,114,308,115,19,2855)}Boo~m
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:07.31,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HE3B4E0&\frz8.504\move(377,49,425,47,19,2855)}{\blur1}Cats and\NFriends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:07.31,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFDBDFD&\c&HFFFFFF&\frz353.2\move(489,116,532,119,19,2855)}{\blur1\i1}Sexy Pub
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:07.31,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,What people call a\Nred light district.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:11.73,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Takioto is very intrigued and\Ninvites Iori to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:15.09,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That's where Iori has a\Nchance encounter with...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:14.52,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HAE5DFB&\pos(228,168)\frz2.313}Secret <3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.87,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The game didn't go into\Na detailed explanation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:31.91,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,but apparently she started a side job\Nbecause she was hard up for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.78,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,If her character became very\Npopular with the gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.50,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,a content patch could\Nhave added a story arc
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.98,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,to explain why she needed the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:44.49,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I think I get the gist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:46.48,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But I still want you\Nto spill your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.66,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,What?! I thought you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:49.08,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Glare...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:50.68,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:52.88,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:56.64,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's just start up the machine\Nand get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.78,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:58.77,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.03,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Um, you're really fine\Nwith using this machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.57,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You're going to figure\Nout the reason why I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.87,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,"can't use emission magic well," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.98,0:07:12.33,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,So... why am I completely naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:15.08,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,That's what it says in this manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:18.80,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:21.19,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Next, we'll attach suction\Ncups all over the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.67,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I-I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Could you please hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:32.12,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I'm... sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:35.36,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Am I being rewarded here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.94,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,This is bad in all sorts of ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.44,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,so please get back up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:39.71,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.69,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nanami, please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:44.49,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I'll turn it on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:55.00,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:08:00.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Physically yes, but mentally I'm\Nhanging on by the skin of my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.02,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:04.74,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But we were able to get\Nsome amount of data!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:08.93,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Looks like the machine was not\Nas thick-skinned as you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:13.81,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Just as I suspected, Anemone-san's\Ncreations are not trustworthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.72,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Can you figure anything out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.19,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.65,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Judging from what I saw earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:24.78,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,it seems that something is blocking\Nthe materialization of magic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.19,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,before it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.74,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Or it could be that\Nsomething is interfering?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:34.37,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,With that said, it's amazing that your\Nlatent mana capacity is this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:37.91,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I'd even say it's a mystery how\Nit can be contained by your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.33,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:43.09,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Could it be that it's not\Nthe amount that's different,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:46.18,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,but that the place it's being\Nstored is fundamentally different?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:47.34,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.56,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,it would lend credence to\NHatsumi's proposed theories
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:53.63,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,of mana proliferation and\Nstorage in other dimensions...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.28,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But if that's true, the\Ntheory Faust advocates for,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.71,main - top,Nanami,0,0,0,,I wonder if this will\Nlead to a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.85,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,and where parts have been\Nproven by many scientists...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:57.85,main - top,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I wonder too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:03.07,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:06.23,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,If I solve this, this will\Nbe a historical discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:09.06,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,This will make for a\Nwonderful research topic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.70,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Then please work on that analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.76,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,But leaving that for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:16.90,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I hope you'll keep your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:17.84,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.71,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Sob...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.42,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Debt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.54,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.24,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:27.68,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Due to debts and taxes,\Nyou ran out of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.68,0:09:29.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Rent was overdue, so you got evicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:33.74,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You were just about to start\Na side job in the red light district
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.84,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,when Anemone-san found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:40.65,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,so you agreed to do whatever\Nshe asks in exchange for her silence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:41.90,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.13,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Is there a contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.19,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:47.10,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,But the people there set up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:50.82,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,a stress-free plan for repayment at\Na rate I can afford every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.05,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I think you're being scammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:53.63,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:56.33,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Why did you neglect things\Nuntil it got this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.03,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:00.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,How long have you been\Nan independent adult?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.51,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:06.51,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd probably want to cry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:09.19,main - top,Ruija,0,0,0,,But, but!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:09.77,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I mean, she's being lectured\Nabout money by a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.97,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.72,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.62,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Hey, Marino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.69,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,The principal?! Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:25.23,sign_16985_199_Dunning_Letter,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(511,40)\frz338.1\frx18\fry2}Dunning Letter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:29.82,main,Marino,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you managed to avoid\Nselling your organs until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:35.31,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In the end, we managed to reduce\NMs. Ruija's debt by a good amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:39.64,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,It did require a lawyer and tax attorney\Nthat the Hanamura family employs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:45.00,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,and going to settle the matter\Nwith some scary-looking men...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:48.94,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Concerning the rest of the debt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:51.61,main,Marino,0,0,0,,we decided that the Hanamura\Nfamily will oversee the entire sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:55.18,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's the safest creditor\NI can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:57.23,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.93,main,Marino,0,0,0,,If you had been some random teacher,\NI would have dismissed you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:03.34,main,Marino,0,0,0,,You should be grateful for both Kou-chan\Nand your track record being so solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:04.54,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.65,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:09.02,main,Marino,0,0,0,,I can't have you living\Non campus like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.49,main,Marino,0,0,0,,so you will move to an apartment\Nmanaged by the Hamamura family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:16.07,main,Marino,0,0,0,,I'll deduct the rent and debt\Npayments from your salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.61,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Unless you take some drastic measures,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:20.77,main,Marino,0,0,0,,it'll take about ten years\Nto pay back the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:22.04,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Ten years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:24.12,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:28.38,main,Marino,0,0,0,,And I have determined that\Nshe needs a supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:30.75,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:33.35,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,After everything she did,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:36.43,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,I'd be way too worried if there wasn't\Nsomeone watching over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:38.72,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The biggest thing is\Nthat she's so gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.40,main,Marino,0,0,0,,So Kou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.10,main,Marino,0,0,0,,You're in charge of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:43.41,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:44.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:48.06,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,The apartment has already\Nbeen transferred to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:49.90,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,The entire building, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:50.99,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:52.52,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Then that's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.11,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,No, it is not fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.70,main,Marino,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:56.07,main,Marino,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:12:01.24,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Then please sign here to give\Ntotal control over you to Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.24,main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\c&HF8F7FA&\3c&HF8F7FA&\4c&HF8F7FA&\1a&H21&\pos(398,11)}m 0 0 l 225 0 225 280 0 280
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.24,sign_19263_238_Labor_Contract__,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(513,280)\c&H020202&}Labor Contract\N\NThe labor contract will be entered\Nwith the following conditions.\NDuration: No limit, so for all life\NRole description: Obey the employer's\Nevery word\NPlace of work: All places\Ndesignated by the employer\NWork hours: Be available 24/7\NBreak times: None\NDays off: No fixed days off\NRemuneration: Maybe, if the employer\Nfeels like it\NResignation: Resignation will not be accepted\NMiscellaneous: Total subjugation\Nis the utmost priority. Do not object ever.\NThe employee vows to follow\Nthese terms and be a loyal worker.\N\NEmployer Name: Takioto Kousuke
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.60,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:06.16,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I just told you that you shouldn't\Nbe signing any random contract!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:08.11,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:10.67,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Now I can sleep in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:12.48,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:14.95,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Please try hard to pay back the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:16.17,main,Ruija,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.40,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.01,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I need to ask you for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:33.81,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master, why are you bothering\Nto go into a beginner dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.31,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.53,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I was thinking of doing an RTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:41.68,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I see. Are you after the special reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.76,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I knew a Dungeon Maid would get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.62,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,308)}[Beginner Dungeon - 1st Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.08,sign_21881_255_Stop,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(353,116)}Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.08,sign_21881_255_Stop,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,164)}Lap
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:48.91,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:49.64,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:55.02,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In a time attack, fighting\Ntrash mobs is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:56.50,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,310)\c&HD9D9DB&}[5th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:13:00.17,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,As we don't need to pick\Nup any XP on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:03.26,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,we just ignore the enemies\Nand go to the next layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.36,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,309)}[6th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.41,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.69,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:13.14,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,309)}[7th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:17.15,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,In the game, you can rush through\Nthe dungeon with any rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.74,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,but in real life that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.04,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,You get out of breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:25.95,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,305)}[8th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:21.51,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,your legs feel like lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:23.75,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,and, because your concentration is shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.95,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,you might even get ambushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:29.12,main - italics top,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Looks like we have to take a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.08,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)}[9th Layer]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.15,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nanami, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:35.54,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Yes. Are we going to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.96,sign_21881_255_Stop,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(354,199)}Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:37.96,sign_21881_255_Stop,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(377,239)}Lap
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,1 hour and 25 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.91,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks like we'll make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.10,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(421,306)}1st Layer {starting at the bottom}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(227,277)}2nd Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:47.20,main - top,Kousuke,0,0,0,,If you make it to layer 10\Nwithin 1 hour and 40 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.69,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(421,254)}3rd Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(224,228)}4th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(423,204)}5th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(224,176)}6th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,150)}7th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(225,126)}8th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:48.95,sign_23163_282_1st_Layer_,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(423,99)}9th Layer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:48.95,sign_23259_291_Within_1_40_00,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H7FFFFE&\pos(115,128)}Within 1:40:00
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:48.51,main - top,Kousuke,0,0,0,,you can go to a special floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:52.14,sign_23351_292_Within_1_40_00,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,322)}Within 1:40:00
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:52.14,main - top,Kousuke,0,0,0,,And it looks like we'll make it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:54.60,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(326,309)}[10th Layer - Special Floor]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.41,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Is this... a maze floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:59.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I'll explain while we run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:00.39,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:05.19,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,There are eight map layouts on this\N10th layer's special floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.41,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Each one has its own forks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:11.04,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,and some of the layouts have\Nevil infinite loops built in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:13.57,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Can you please memorize the routes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:14.46,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:19.88,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,First there was a T intersection,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.61,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,to the east a 4-way intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:25.59,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Next we went north and hit\Na 4-way intersection again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:26.30,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:29.57,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,That settles it, this is layout D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:35.60,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Then from here, we have to go east,\Nsouth, west, south, south, east, north!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.27,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:41.81,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:43.81,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,1 hour and 56 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.57,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,The condition for the reward
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:50.66,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,is to clear everything from the 1st\Nlayer to the final boss within 2 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.08,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,4 minutes left...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.58,sign_21788_254__Beginner_Dungeo,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(322,306)}[11th Layer - Boss Room]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.16,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Let me handle—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:03.01,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,No, there's a quick way\Nto defeat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.12,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:13.09,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.00,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.00,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That didn't even take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:35.87,main,GoddessStatue,0,0,0,,You have done well to defeat the\Nevil and stand here before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:40.29,main,GoddessStatue,0,0,0,,For your achievement,\NI will grant you a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.69,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It looks like you acquired\Nan Increase Stamina spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:47.47,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:50.53,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,There are five types of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:52.59,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,You randomly get one type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:55.07,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,If you want to develop\Nthe strongest character,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:57.31,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,you cannot skip acquiring these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.81,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be\Ncoming here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:06.56,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,We have to see how much\Nfurther we can run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.64,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I don't mind going into a dungeon again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.45,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,but school's already over...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.39,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I have a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:18.04,sign_26855_337_Treadmill,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFDCC6B&\fs24\b1\pos(312,287)}Treadmill
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.04,main - top,Nanami,0,0,0,,Treadmill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:22.10,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Huge rain, typhoon,\Nhuge snow, huge Nanami,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:23.37,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,regardless of the conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:26.17,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,you can now run whenever\Nyou want, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.72,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What's huge Nanami, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:32.24,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,You know, the thing that\Ncomes seven times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.09,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:37.39,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,This is a fancy machine though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:39.62,main,Claris,0,0,0,,It's got an odd form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:43.35,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,The other day, I found a\Nsuspicious antique store.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.33,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I bought a bunch of bargain bin items,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:49.53,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,interpreted the mysterious\Nbits using my own theories,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:51.03,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,and then put this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:55.70,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I just heard a lot of\Nwords I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.84,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Why don't you give it a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.96,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It's very easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:06.16,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,My bad feeling is off the charts,\Nbut why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:08.34,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,It's off the charts,\Nand you still get on...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.76,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_357_Select_User,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz8.191\pos(255,34)}Select User
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz7.354\pos(349,40)}Takioto Kousuke
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz7.627\pos(405,76)}Gender: Male
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,117)}Height
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(333,142)}Weight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(206,252)}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.43,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(452,204)}Proceed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:16.05,main - top,Nanami,0,0,0,,I have already completed\Nyour user registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:19.36,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Name, gender, physical stats, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:19.32,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz9.395\fs14\move(504,92,501,58,24,3236)}Takioto Kousuke
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:19.32,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz9.395\fs14\move(568,175,564,142,24,3236)}Gender:\NMale
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:20.07,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:24.81,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,How come you know my measurements\Ndown to the decimals?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:29.94,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,You can also get data on your body\Nfat percentage and burned calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:33.06,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,This can also be sent to\Nyour Tsukuyomi Traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:36.49,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,That's quite useful.\NI would like to use it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:38.20,main,Claris,0,0,0,,I would also be very interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:40.49,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:44.83,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I have already registered\Neveryone here as users.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.73,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,However, everyone but Master
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:52.06,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,will have to select a main\Nmaid or a main butler first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:55.03,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What does main maid even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.59,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Someone who helps with the running.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.23,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Just go like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:02.35,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\frz6.232\pos(255,32)}Select Mode
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.41,main - italics,NanamiVoice,0,0,0,,Please use the touch screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:02.35,main - italics,NanamiVoice,0,0,0,,Or please use voice commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.52,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh, that's your voice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:07.31,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Naturally, I am your main maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:11.85,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,For the main butler, I went\Nahead and used Master's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:14.34,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.28,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Yes, that sounds like\Na convenient feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:19.78,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Then let's set a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:25.29,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A001C&\frz16.16\fs14\move(431,142,346,185,25,5489)}Target
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:24.16,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,The default is set to 42.195 km.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:25.29,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,That's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:27.48,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,That's a pretty normal distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.69,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Claris-dono, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.03,main,Claris,0,0,0,,I think this is geared toward\NTakioto-sama and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:35.83,main,Hatsumi,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:42.83,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What are these buttons for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:47.63,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I haven't fully grasped\Neverything they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:49.15,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,so please refrain from pushing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:51.88,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What do you mean, haven't grasped?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.36,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a used item\Nfrom a dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.74,main,Hatsumi,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:56.24,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:19:00.45,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.96,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:09.45,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,This must be the divine wind function.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.06,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,The amount of wind is based\Non your running speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:14.17,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It appears to have three levels:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.47,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,violation of space, loss\Nof dignity, and Sukhavati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:18.88,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,This is totally a function\Nfor seeing panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:20.26,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Actually! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:21.00,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:23.18,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I can't get off, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.93,main,Claris,0,0,0,,Hatsumi-sama! Hit the stop button!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:26.93,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\3c&H7649F5&\c&HFFFFFF&\b1\frz10.45\pos(200,187)}Pause
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:26.93,sign_10776_104_Encounter_Cafe,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HED6437&\b1\frz11.07\pos(362,157)}Resume
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:34.15,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Everyone, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:37.05,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Th-This machine is... stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:38.81,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,So shameless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:41.23,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a used item from a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:44.87,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,But I understand your concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.91,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,If you push this button here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:49.80,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh, that smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:52.29,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I added a special aroma function.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:55.23,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Well, it is actually soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:56.80,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,It's a mixture of Nanami essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:58.83,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,The hell is Nanami essence?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:00.21,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Are you maybe related to clams?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:02.66,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I can't believe... you're\Nmaking me say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:04.39,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Why are you getting embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:12.02,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,72)}Cold\NAir
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:12.02,sign_28214_358_Takioto_Kousuke,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(189,45)}Warm\NAir
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:08.44,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,On top of that, you can have\Nit blow cold or warm air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.44,0:20:09.36,main,Hatsumi,0,0,0,,Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:13.06,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh, it got a bit warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:16.17,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,This is so wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:21.02,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Why do we have to have hot air blown at\Nus when we're already hot from running?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:22.92,main,Claris,0,0,0,,Ludie-sama, please calm yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:25.15,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Huh? It keeps getting\Nhotter and hotter...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:28.77,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot! It's really hot now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.35,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I'm getting burned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:31.83,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Takioto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:33.15,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,The cold air button!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:35.17,main,Hatsumi,0,0,0,,I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:37.20,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Do something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.05,main,NanamiVoice,0,0,0,,Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:46.64,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,Master is unharmed, as a protection\Nspell was cast on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:50.64,main,Nanami,0,0,0,,I have also tried this, and\Nit was quite exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:52.98,main,Ludie,0,0,0,,Kousuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:57.42,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,So this hole... was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:02.57,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Are you really all right, Takioto?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:04.46,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:05.57,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,And it has been decided that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:09.16,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Nanami will fix that machine under\Nthe supervision of Claris-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:13.24,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Right, we have to thank\NClaris-dono for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:14.23,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:16.95,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Why are you trying this hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.63,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Aren't you overdoing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:21.88,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Rest is also necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.18,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:25.92,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,You train more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:26.95,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.00,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,If I want to become the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:31.10,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,I have to do things properly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:33.81,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,Well, my real reason
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:37.68,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,of wanting to guide all the\Nheroines to the happy ending
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:39.41,main - italics,Kousuke(M),0,0,0,,is not something I intend to reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:41.11,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,The strongest...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:44.44,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Don't you want to get stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:45.95,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.16,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Then let's get stronger together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:50.62,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:54.53,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Oh right, do you want to\Ngo to a dungeon together?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.53,0:21:55.81,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,To a dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:58.74,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,Is that... a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:02.22,main,Yukine,0,0,0,,No. If I don't have obligations,\NI don't mind going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:07.41,main,Kousuke,0,0,0,,That's a promise!

